{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35713","headline":"小松歌 · 李咸用","name":"小松歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人不喜凡草生，秋锄斸得寒青青。\n庭闲土瘦根脚狞，风摇雨拂精神醒。\n短影月斜不满尺，清声细入鸣蛩翼。\n天人戏剪苍龙髯，参差簇在瑶堦侧。\n金精水鬼欺不得，长与东皇逞颜色。\n劲节暂因君子移，贞心不爲麻中直。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}